sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Reader
    participant C as Card
    Note over R,C: Challenge-response
    R->>C: Random challenge
    Note over C: Computes response with<br/>internal secret key
    C->>R: Response only — key never transmitted
    Note over R: Verifies response
    Note over R,C: Wiegand, by contrast
    C->>R: Same ID number every time (replayable)
